efore a view-layer update; it was not rerun in this session.", "The historical relocated hinge candidate is not established as a structural repair; no selection-scene hinge clearance or opening was validated.", "AABB overlap and near-zero ray gaps are not confirmed intersection or contact."],\n  "changes": ["Updated /app/library/SKILL.md to distinguish scene-changing operations and require a view-layer update after camera or scene edits before projection. No Python candidate was changed."],\n  "remaining_unvalidated_methods": ["No independent reconstruction or transfer improvement established; joint optimization, controlled visual appearance comparisons, real-image material matching, light separation, UV and Object coordinate outputs, image resources, nontrivial occlusions, wall openings and hinge sweep clearance remain unvalidated.", "Support sampling beyond the tested simple boxes, whole-assembly versus internal-part repairs, and physical contact/connectivity remain unvalidated."],\n  "applicability_and_side_effects": "Projection requires updated scene and does not establish visibility or unique depth. Hinge pose moves the complete parented assembly, but anchor error does not establish opening, clearance, or collision-free motion. Material creation adds a datablock; assignment was performed explicitly by the probe. Generated coordinates and links were checked, but no render established appearance. Support rays are low-vertex screening: unknown is not absence, near-zero is not proof of contact, and penetration is only a candidate. Bounds separation is broad-phase only.",\n  "final_library_files": ["/app/library/SKILL.md", "/app/library/capabilities.json", "/app/library/methods.py"]\n}\n'}}], 'model': 'gpt-6.1-terra', 'parent_tool_use_id': None, 'error': None, 'usage': {'input_tokens': 0, 'output_tokens': 0, 'cache_creation_input_tokens': 0, 'cache_read_input_tokens': 0}, 'message_id': 'msg_78edd166-4afd-4d02-8bb5-2ff9df2aef61', 'stop_reason': None, 'session_id': '1